      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثْوَلُ</span></b>  <i>Mad,</i> or <i>possessed:</i> and <i>stupid, foolish,</i> or
<i>disordered in intellect:</i> (M, K:) and, applied to
a ram (M, Msb) or he-goat, (S, Msb,) <i>affected
by what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَوَل</span>, explained above; fem.

